PICTURE
- Every frame is drawn by the code in src/ (Canvas 2D), captured with Playwright / Chromium and encoded with ffmpeg.
  No generated or stock images. Style: the owner's "Golden Hour Stickman" (my-styles/golden-hour-stickman).
- Rendering toolkit: Lemo-Opuscar core tools (MIT).
